(83, 'a', '\nAbrasive', ' â€”adj. 1 a tending to rub or graze. B capable of polishing by rubbing or grinding. 2 harsh or hurtful in manner. â€”n. Abrasive substance.'),
(84, 'a', '\nAbreast', ' adv. 1 side by side and facing the same way. 2 (foll. By of) up to date.'),
