(443, 'a', '\nAf', ' abbr. Audio frequency.'),
(444, 'a', '\nAfar', ' adv. At or to a distance.'),
(445, 'a', '\nAffable', ' adj. 1 friendly. 2 courteous.  affability n. Affably adv. [latin affabilis]'),
(446, 'a', '\nAffair', ' n. 1 matter, concern, or thing to be attended to (that is my affair). 2 a celebrated or notorious happening. B colloq. Thing or event (puzzling affair). 3 = *love affair. 4 (in pl.) Public or private business. [french Ã  faire to do]'),
