(2926, 'b', '\r\nBlunt', ' â€”adj. 1 not sharp or pointed. 2 direct, outspoken. â€”v. Make blunt or less sharp.  bluntly adv. (in sense 2 of adj.). Bluntness n. [probably scandinavian]'),
