(3323, 'b', '\r\nBraze', ' v. (-zing) solder with an alloy of brass and zinc. [french braser]'),
(3324, 'b', '\r\nBrazen', ' â€”adj. 1 shameless; insolent. 2 of or like brass. 3 harsh in sound. â€”v. (foll. By out) face or undergo defiantly (brazen it out).  brazenly adv. [old english]'),
(3325, 'b', '\r\nBrazier1', ' n. Metal pan or stand holding burning coals etc. [french: related to *braise]'),
