(7600, 'c', '\r\nCatholic', ' â€”adj. 1 all-embracing; of wide sympathies or interests. 2 of interest or use to all; universal. 3 (catholic) a roman catholic. B including all christians, or all of the western church. â€”n. (catholic) roman catholic.  catholicism n. Catholicity n. [greek holos whole]'),
