(8546, 'c', '\r\nCo-', ' prefix added to: 1 nouns, with the sense â€˜joint, mutual, commonâ€™ (co-author; coequality). 2 adjectives and adverbs, with the sense â€˜jointly, mutuallyâ€™ (coequal). 3 verbs, with the sense â€˜together with another or othersâ€™ (cooperate). [var. Of *com-]'),
