(8548, 'c', '\r\nCoach', ' â€”n. 1 single-decker bus, usu. Comfortably equipped for long journeys. 2 railway carriage. 3 closed horse-drawn carriage. 4 a instructor or trainer in a sport. B private tutor. â€”v. Train or teach as a coach. [french from magyar]'),
