(8625, 'c', '\r\nCoconut', 'shy  n. Fairground sideshow where balls are thrown to dislodge coconuts.'),
(8626, 'c', '\r\nCocoon', ' â€”n. 1 silky case spun by insect larvae for protection as pupae. 2 protective covering. â€”v. Wrap or coat in a cocoon. [provenÃ§al coca shell]'),
