(9205, 'c', '\r\nCongressman', ' n. (fem. Congresswoman) member of the us congress.'),
(9206, 'c', '\r\nCongruent', ' adj. 1 (often foll. By with) suitable, agreeing. 2 geom. (of figures) coinciding exactly when superimposed.  congruence n. Congruency n. [latin congruo agree]'),
