(9486, 'c', '\r\nCoon', ' n. 1 us racoon. 2 slang offens. Black. [abbreviation]'),
(9487, 'c', '\r\nCoop', ' â€”n. Cage for keeping poultry. â€”v. (often foll. By up, in) confine (a person). [latin cupa cask]'),
