(9751, 'c', '\r\nCouple', ' â€”n. 1 a two (a couple of girls). B about two (a couple of hours). 2 a two people who are married to, or in a sexual relationship with, each other. B pair of partners in a dance etc. â€”v. (-ling) 1 link together. 2 associate in thought or speech. 3 copulate. [latin *copula]'),
