(9878, 'c', '\r\nCrap', ' coarse slang â€”n. 1 (often as int. Or attrib.) Nonsense, rubbish. 2 faeces. â€”v. (-pp-) defecate.  crappy adj. (-ier, -iest). [dutch]'),
