(13878, 'e', '\r\nEffort', ' n. 1 use of physical or mental energy. 2 determined attempt. 3 force exerted. 4 colloq. Something accomplished. [latin fortis strong]'),
(13879, 'e', '\r\nEffortless', ' adj. Easily done, requiring no effort.  effortlessly adv. Effortlessness n.'),
