(13919, 'e', '\r\nEighty', ' adj. & n. (pl. -ies) 1 eight times ten. 2 symbol for this (80, lxxx, lxxx). 3 (in pl.) Numbers from 80 to 89, esp. The years of a century or of a person''s life.  eightieth adj. & n. [old english]'),
