(14054, 'e', '\r\nElixir', ' n. 1 a alchemist''s preparation supposedly able to change metals into gold or (in full elixir of life) to prolong life indefinitely. B remedy for all ills. 2 aromatic medicinal drug. [latin from arabic]'),
