(14157, 'e', '\r\nEmploy', ' â€”v. 1 use the services of (a person) in return for payment. 2 use (a thing, time, energy, etc.) To good effect. 3 keep (a person) occupied. â€”n. (in phr. In the employ of) employed by.  employable adj. Employer n. [latin implicor be involved]'),
