(14532, 'e', '\r\nEskimo', ' â€”n. (pl. Same or -s) 1 member of a people inhabiting n. Canada, alaska, greenland, and e. Siberia. 2 language of this people. â€”adj. Of eskimos or their language. [algonquian]'),
