(14649, 'e', '\r\nEstate', 'car  n. Car with a continuous area for rear passengers and luggage.'),
(14650, 'e', '\r\nEstate', 'duty  n. Hist. Death duty.'),
(14651, 'e', '\r\nUsage', ' estate duty was replaced in 1975 by capital transfer tax and in 1986 by inheritance tax.'),
(14652, 'e', '\r\nEsteem', ' â€”v. 1 (usu. In passive) have a high regard for. 2 formal consider (esteemed it an honour). â€”n. High regard; favour. [latin: related to *estimate]'),
