(14657, 'e', '\r\nEstonian', ' â€”n. 1 a native or national of estonia in eastern europe. B person of estonian descent. 2 language of estonia. â€”adj. Of estonia, its people, or language.'),
(14658, 'e', '\r\nEstrange', ' v. (-ging) 1 (usu. In passive; often foll. By from) alienate; make hostile or indifferent. 2 (as estranged adj.) (of a husband or wife) no longer living with his or her spouse.  estrangement n. [latin: related to *strange]'),
