(14686, 'e', '\r\nEthylene', ' n. A hydrocarbon of the alkene series.'),
(14687, 'e', '\r\nEtiolate', ' v. (-ting) 1 make (a plant) pale by excluding light. 2 give a sickly colour to (a person).  etiolation n. [latin stipula straw]'),
