(14966, 'e', '\r\nExquisite', ' adj. 1 extremely beautiful or delicate. 2 keenly felt (exquisite pleasure). 3 highly sensitive (exquisite taste).  exquisitely adv. [latin exquiro -quisit- seek out]'),
