(14968, 'f', 'F1', ' n. (also f) (pl. Fs or f''s) 1 sixth letter of the alphabet. 2 mus. Fourth note of the diatonic scale of c major.'),
(14969, 'f', '\r\nF2', ' abbr. (also f.) 1 fahrenheit. 2 farad(s). 3 fine (pencil-lead).'),
(14970, 'f', '\r\nF3', ' symb. Fluorine.'),
