(15345, 'f', '\r\nFetid', ' adj. (also foetid) stinking. [latin feteo stink]'),
(15346, 'f', '\r\nFetish', ' n. 1 psychol. Abnormal object of sexual desire. 2 a object worshipped by primitive peoples. B obsessional cause (makes a fetish of punctuality).  fetishism n. Fetishist n. Fetishistic adj. [portuguese feitiÃ§o charm]'),
