(15424, 'f', '\r\nFifty', ' adj. & n. (pl. -ies) 1 five times ten. 2 symbol for this (50, l, l). 3 (in pl.) Numbers from 50 to 59, esp. The years of a century or of a person''s life.  fiftieth adj. & n. [old english]'),
