(16354, 'f', '\r\nFreepost', ' n. System of business post where postage is paid by the addressee.'),
(16355, 'f', '\r\nFree', 'radical  n. Chem. Atom or group of atoms with one or more unpaired electrons.'),
(16356, 'f', '\r\nFree-range', ' adj. 1 (of hens etc.) Roaming freely; not kept in a battery. 2 (of eggs) produced by such hens.'),
