(16505, 'f', '\r\nFruit', 'sugar  n. Fructose.'),
(16506, 'f', '\r\nFruity', ' adj. (-ier, -iest) 1 a of fruit. B tasting or smelling like fruit. 2 (of a voice etc.) Deep and rich. 3 colloq. Slightly indecent or suggestive.  fruitily adv. Fruitiness n.'),
