(17235, 'g', '\r\nGob1', ' n. Slang mouth. [origin unknown]'),
(17236, 'g', '\r\nGob2', ' slang â€”n. Clot of slimy matter. â€”v. (-bb-) spit. [french go(u)be mouthful]'),
