(17242, 'g', '\r\nGoblet', ' n. Drinking-vessel with a foot and stem. [french diminutive of gobel cup]'),
(17243, 'g', '\r\nGoblin', ' n. Mischievous ugly dwarflike creature of folklore. [anglo-french]'),
