(17276, 'g', '\r\nGold', ' â€”n. 1 precious yellow metallic element. 2 colour of gold. 3 a coins or articles made of gold. B wealth. 4 something precious or beautiful. 5 = *gold medal. â€”adj. 1 made wholly or chiefly of gold. 2 coloured like gold. [old english]'),
