(17844, 'g', '\r\nGynae', ' n. (also gynie) colloq. Gynaecology. [abbreviation]'),
(17845, 'g', '\r\nGynaecology', ' n. (us gynecology) science of the physiological functions and diseases of women.  gynaecological adj. Gynaecologist n. [greek gune gunaik- woman, *-logy]'),
