(17869, 'h', '\r\nHabit-forming', ' adj. Causing addiction.'),
(17870, 'h', '\r\nHabitual', ' adj. 1 done constantly or as a habit. 2 regular, usual. 3 given to a (specified) habit (habitual smoker).  habitually adv.'),
