(18665, 'h', '\r\nHistoric', ' adj. 1 famous or important in history or potentially so (historic moment). 2 gram. (of a tense) used to narrate past events.'),
(18666, 'h', '\r\nHistorical', ' adj. 1 of or concerning history (historical evidence). 2 (of the study of a subject) showing its development over a period. 3 factual, not fictional or legendary. 4 belonging to the past, not the present. 5 (of a novel etc.) Dealing with historical events.  historically adv.'),
