(18955, 'h', '\r\nHermaphrodite', ' â€”n. Person, animal, or plant having both male and female reproductive organs. â€”adj. Combining both sexes.  hermaphroditic adj. [from hermaphroditus, son of hermes and aphrodite who became joined in one body to a nymph]'),
