(18970, 'h', '\r\nHazard', ' â€”n. 1 danger or risk. 2 source of this. 3 golf obstacle, e.g. A bunker. â€”v. 1 venture (hazard a guess). 2 risk. [arabic az-zahr chance, luck]'),
(18971, 'h', '\r\nHazardous', ' adj. Risky.'),
