(20106, 'i', '\r\nIdÃ©e', 'fixe  n. (pl. IdÃ©es fixes pronunc. Same) dominating idea; obsession. [french, = fixed idea]'),
(20107, 'i', '\r\nIdentical', ' adj. 1 (often foll. By with) (of different things) absolutely alike. 2 one and the same. 3 (of twins) developed from a single ovum.  identically adv. [latin identicus: related to *identity]'),
