(20198, 'i', '\r\nImagine', ' v. (-ning) 1 a form a mental image or concept of. B picture to oneself. 2 think of as probable (can''t imagine he''d be so stupid). 3 guess (can''t imagine what he is doing). 4 suppose (i imagine you''ll need help).  imaginable adj. [latin imaginor] '),
