(20683, 'i', '\r\nInferior', ' â€”adj. 1 (often foll. By to) lower in rank, quality, etc. 2 of poor quality. 3 situated below. 4 written or printed below the line. â€”n. Person inferior to another, esp. In rank. [latin, comparative of inferus]'),
