(20916, 'i', '\r\nInstant', ' â€”adj. 1 occurring immediately. 2 (of food etc.) Processed for quick preparation. 3 urgent; pressing. 4 commerce of the current month (the 6th instant). â€”n. 1 precise moment (come here this instant). 2 short space of time (in an instant). [latin insto be urgent]'),
