(20959, 'i', '\r\nInteger', ' n. Whole number. [latin, = untouched, whole]'),
(20960, 'i', '\r\nIntegral', ' â€”adj. Also 1 a of or necessary to a whole. B forming a whole. C complete. 2 of or denoted by an integer. â€”n. Math. Quantity of which a given function is the derivative.  integrally adv. [latin: related to *integer]'),
