(21305, 'i', '\r\n-ish', ' suffix forming adjectives: 1 from nouns, meaning: a having the qualities of (boyish). B of the nationality of (danish). 2 from adjectives, meaning â€˜somewhatâ€™ (thickish). 3 colloq. Denoting an approximate age or time of day (fortyish; six-thirtyish). [old english]'),
