(21404, 'j', '\r\nJaguar', ' n. Large american flesh-eating spotted animal of the cat family. [tupi]'),
(21405, 'j', '\r\nJail', ' (also gaol) â€”n. 1 place for the detention of prisoners. 2 confinement in a jail. â€”v. Put in jail. [french jaiole, ultimately from latin cavea cage]'),
