(21456, 'j', '\r\nJeepers', ' int. Us slang expressing surprise etc. [corruption of jesus]'),
(21457, 'j', '\r\nJeer', ' â€”v. (often foll. By at) scoff derisively; deride. â€”n. Taunt.  jeeringly adv. [origin unknown]'),
