(21906, 'k', '\r\nKiss', 'of death  n. Apparent good luck etc. Which causes ruin.'),
(21907, 'k', '\r\nKiss', 'of life  n. Mouth-to-mouth resuscitation.'),
(21908, 'k', '\r\nKissogram', ' n. (also kissagram propr.) Novelty telegram or greeting delivered with a kiss.'),
(21909, 'k', '\r\nKit', ' â€”n. 1 articles, equipment, etc. For a specific purpose (first-aid kit). 2 specialized, esp. Sports, clothing or uniform (football kit). 3 set of parts needed to assemble furniture, a model, etc. â€”v. (-tt-) (often foll.'),
