(22848, 'l', '\r\nLira', ' n. (pl. Lire pronunc. Same or) 1 chief monetary unit of italy. 2 chief monetary unit of turkey. [latin libra pound]'),
(22849, 'l', '\r\nLisle', ' n. Fine cotton thread for stockings etc. [lille in france]'),
