(25190, 'm', '\r\nMulligatawny', ' n. Highly seasoned soup orig. From india. [tamil, = pepper-water]'),
(25191, 'm', '\r\nMullion', ' n. Vertical bar dividing the lights in a window.  mullioned adj. [probably french moinel middle: related to *mean3]'),
(25192, 'm', '\r\nMulti-', ' comb. Form many. [latin multus much, many]'),
