(25278, 'm', '\r\nMusician', ' n. Person who plays a musical instrument, esp. Professionally.  musicianly adj. Musicianship n. [french: related to *music]'),
(25279, 'm', '\r\nMusicology', ' n. The academic study of music.  musicologist n. Musicological adj.'),
