(26416, 'o', '\r\nOneness', ' n. 1 singleness. 2 uniqueness. 3 agreement. 4 sameness.'),
(26417, 'o', '\r\nOne-night', 'stand  n. 1 single performance of a play etc. In a place. 2 colloq. Sexual liaison lasting only one night.'),
