(26656, 'o', '\r\nOrtolan', ' n.  European bunting, eaten as a delicacy. [latin hortus garden]'),
(26657, 'o', '\r\n-ory', ' suffix 1 forming nouns denoting a place (dormitory; refectory). 2 forming adjectives and nouns relating to or involving a verbal action (accessory; compulsory). [latin -orius, -orium]'),
