(26959, 'o', '\r\nOverwork', ' â€”v. 1 (cause to) work too hard. 2 weary or exhaust with too much work. 3 (esp. As overworked adj.) Make excessive use of (an overworked phrase). 4 (as overworked adj.) = *overwrought 2. â€”n. Excessive work.'),
