(27060, 'p', '\r\nPaederasty', ' var. Of *pederasty.'),
(27061, 'p', '\r\nPaediatrics', ' n.pl. (treated as sing.) (us pediatrics) branch of medicine dealing with children and their diseases.  paediatric adj. Paediatrician n. [from *paedo-, greek iatros physician]'),
