(27113, 'p', '\r\nPalatal', ' â€”adj. 1 of the palate. 2 (of a sound) made by placing the tongue against the hard palate (e.g. Y in yes). â€”n. Palatal sound.'),
(27114, 'p', '\r\nPalate', ' n. 1 structure closing the upper part of the mouth cavity in vertebrates. 2 sense of taste. 3 mental taste; liking. [latin palatum]'),
