(28829, 'p', '\r\nPortfolio', ' n. (pl. -s) 1 a folder for loose sheets of paper, drawings, etc. B samples of an artist''s work. 2 range of investments held by a person, company, etc. 3 office of a minister of state (cf. *minister without portfolio). [italian portafogli sheet-carrier]'),
