(29028, 'p', '\r\nPrayer1', ' n. 1 a request or thanksgiving to god or an object of worship. B formula used in praying (the lord''s prayer). C act of praying. D religious service consisting largely of prayers (morning prayer). 2 entreaty to a person. [latin: related to *precarious]'),
