(29033, 'p', '\r\nPraying', 'mantis  see *mantis.'),
(29034, 'p', '\r\nPre-', ' prefix before (in time, place, order, degree, or importance). [latin prae before]'),
(29035, 'p', '\r\nPreach', ' v. 1  (also absol.) Deliver (a sermon); proclaim or expound (the gospel etc.). 2 give moral advice in an obtrusive way. 3 advocate or inculcate (a quality or practice etc.).  preacher n. [latin praedico proclaim]'),
