(32691, 's', '\r\nSecond-hand', ' â€”adj. 1 a having had a previous owner; not new. B (attrib.) (of a shop etc.) Where such goods can be bought. 2 (of information etc.) Indirect, not from one''s own observation etc. â€”adv. 1 on a second-hand basis. 2 indirectly.'),
