(32707, 's', '\r\nSecretary', ' n. (pl. -ies) 1 employee who assists with correspondence, records, making appointments, etc. 2 official of a society or company who writes letters, organizes business, etc. 3 principal assistant of a government minister, ambassador, etc.  secretarial adj. Secretaryship n. [latin secretarius: related to *secret]'),
