(32764, 's', '\r\nSegment', ' â€”n. 1 each part into which a thing is or can be divided. 2 part of a circle or sphere etc. Cut off by an intersecting line or plane. â€”v. Usu. Divide into segments.  segmental adj. Segmentation n. [latin seco cut]'),
