(32819, 's', '\r\nSelf-destruct', ' â€”v. (of a spacecraft, bomb, etc.) Explode or disintegrate automatically, esp. When pre-set to do so. â€”attrib. Adj. Enabling a thing to self-destruct (self-destruct device).'),
