(34187, 's', '\r\nSod2', ' coarse slang â€”n. 1 unpleasant or awkward person or thing. 2 fellow (lucky sod). â€”v. (-dd-) 1 damn (sod them!). 2 (as sodding adj.) Damned.  sod off go away. [abbreviation of *sodomite]'),
