(34190, 's', '\r\nSoda', 'fountain  n. 1 device supplying soda water. 2 shop or counter with this.'),
(34191, 's', '\r\nSodden', ' adj. 1 saturated; soaked through. 2 stupid or dull etc. With drunkenness. [archaic past part. Of *seethe]'),
