(34198, 's', '\r\nSodomite', ' n. Person who practises sodomy. [greek: related to *sodomy]'),
(34199, 's', '\r\nSodomy', ' n. = *buggery.  sodomize v. (also -ise) (-zing or -sing). [latin from sodom: gen. 18,19]'),
