(34266, 's', '\r\nSoli', ' pl. Of *solo.'),
(34267, 's', '\r\nSolicit', ' v. (-t-) 1 seek (esp. Business) repeatedly or earnestly. 2 (also absol.) Accost as a prostitute.  solicitation n. [latin sollicitus anxious]'),
