(34311, 's', '\r\nSomewhere', ' â€”adv. In or to some place. â€”pron. Some unspecified place.'),
(34312, 's', '\r\nSomnambulism', ' n. Sleepwalking.  somnambulant adj. Somnambulist n. [latin somnus sleep, ambulo walk]'),
