(35731, 's', '\r\nSunday', ' â€”n. 1 first day of the week, a christian holiday and day of worship. 2 colloq. Newspaper published on sundays. â€”adv. Colloq. 1 on sunday. 2 (sundays) on sundays; each sunday. [old english]'),
