(40618, 'w', '\r\nWithout', ' â€”prep. 1 not having or feeling or showing. 2 with freedom from. 3 in the absence of. 4 with neglect or avoidance of. 5 archaic outside. â€”adv. Archaic or literary 1 outside. 2 out of doors. [old english: related to *with, *out]'),
