(41094, 'z', '\r\nZigzag', ' â€”adj. With abrupt alternate right and left turns (zigzag line). â€”n. Zigzag line; thing having the form of a zigzag or having sharp turns. â€”adv. With a zigzag course. â€”v. (-gg-) move in a zigzag course. [french from german]'),
